  "content": "Week 24: I am now officially a Master of Science in Engineering 🥳\n\nBeen sitting in the rain for 1 hour, finally got my diploma.\n\nGraduation\n\nMartin\n\nJaagup\n\nWilliam\n\nKa on\n\nYet, I am still working for my PhD application. As the only person who finished the study, I am still sitting down and reading papers. While my roommates are either doing a FIFA travel or a Baltic country travel. Seems I should be doing these... Ahhh, guess this is the destiny 😓. I have to sacrifice for something I love...",
